  "prefLabel": "Ahp 104.02 Notice of Board Meetings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ahp 104.02 Notice of Board Meetings.\n\n(a) Notice of the time and place of board meetings, excluding emergency meetings, shall be given in accordance with RSA 91-A:2, II.\n\n(b) Information about the time and place of board meetings shall also be available at the numbers stated in Ahp 105.01 (b) and (c).\n\nSource. #12724, eff 2-15-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ahp100-600.html"
